# Bosses
boss-warg = Blackfang
boss-troll = Grogoth
boss-muldant = Lord Muldant
quest-boss = Defeat the boss
dlg-bw_01 = That size... That is no wolf. That's the pack leader.
dlg-bw_02 = Blackfang. Every time he howls, more wolves come running. Don't let him!
dlg-bw_03 = The more hurt he is, the more he calls. Take him down fast!
dlg-bw_04 = All together. Let's put him down.
dlg-bt_01 = The ground is shaking... That's Grogoth, the crowned troll of the libraries.
dlg-bt_02 = He pounds the ground with his fists. When the red circle appears, get out of it!
dlg-bt_03 = At half health he'll fly into a rage and call his goblins.
dlg-bt_04 = I'll hold his attention. Hit him from behind!
dlg-bm_01 = Lord Muldant! He holds the Ancestral Stone. Break its power, and the kingdom will live!
dlg-bm_02 = That black lightning... it comes from him. I can feel the stone beating on his chest.
dlg-bm_03 = He's huge! Leave the purple circles as soon as they appear!
dlg-bm_04 = He will call the dead to his aid. Don't let yourselves be surrounded.
dlg-bm_05 = One last effort. After him, nothing stands in our way!
dlg-samelia_freed_01 = Thank you, brave heroes! Those jailers had caught me in their nets.
dlg-samelia_freed_02 = Princess! Stay behind us.
dlg-samelia_freed_03 = The hardest part is still ahead: Lord Muldant is at the very top of the tower. I will clear the way.
